Salary Band


Validate that Salary Band is populated correctly in the NCMI output and review all populated salary band values for unexpected or unmapped classifications.


Only the defined Salary Band classifications should be populated in the NCMI output. Records with no Net Monthly Income Amount should be classified as 'Unknown'. No unexpected Salary Band values should be present.


SELECT
    SALARY_BAND,
    COUNT(*) AS RECORD_COUNT,
    SUM(COALESCE(APPLICATION_COUNT, 0)) AS APPLICATION_VOLUME,

    CASE
        WHEN SALARY_BAND IN (
            'Unknown',
            'Under £10k',
            '£10k-£15k',
            '£15k-£22.5k',
            '£22.5k-£30k',
            '£30k-£50k',
            '£50k-£75k',
            '£75k-£150k',
            '£150k-£250k',
            '£250k-£500k',
            '£500k+'
        )
        THEN 'PASS'
        ELSE 'FAIL'
    END AS TEST_RESULT

FROM BDP_UK_CARDS.FACT_CARD_AGGREGATOR_APPLICATION_SUMMARY

GROUP BY SALARY_BAND

ORDER BY APPLICATION_VOLUME DESC;